{
  "name": "maint-evidence-v2-20261009",
  "description": "Cited evidence from the Tizert copper mine maintenance corpus (Managem / SENET project SP0904): one row per chunk of one distinct source file. Files are filed by plant zone and equipment dossier (for example 'Concentrate Stockpile Feed Conveyor N°2 6520-CV-5237') and include vendor manuals, datasheets, process flow diagrams, engineering and shop drawings (PDF and DWG), IFC model summaries and spreadsheets, in French and English. title names the document, its equipment folder and the cited page or sheet; identifiers holds equipment tags (pattern 6520-CV-5237), SENET document codes (pattern SP0904-...), drawing part marks and process stream labels printed in the chunk or named in its folder paths; source_path is the canonical corpus location and source_paths lists every folder holding a copy of the same file. document_class is the document type named by its category folder (plan, manufacturer_manual, technical_datasheet, bom, operating_procedure, preventive_maintenance, electrical_instrumentation_schematic, lubrication, certificate, catalogue, calculation_note, model, otherwise unclassified). Every row belongs to one ingestion release (release_id). Use it for equipment, maintenance, drawing, part and process questions; quote numbers, tags and revisions only from returned content and cite title with original_page_numbers or drawing_sheet_id.",
